2 CONC y the monument of Anne de Montmorency. The tomb was destroyed in 1792 and the statue, known as "La Renommée," now resides in the Louvre (other fragments of the tomb, including marble heads of the duke and duchess, are in the museu
2 CONC m of Aquitaine, in Bordeaux).
