1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Charles I, Duke of Mantua
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Catherine of Mayenne, daughter of Charles of Lorraine, Duke of Mayenne and Henriette of Savoy, Marquise de Villars. They had six children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis I, Duke of Rethel (1606 - 1622).
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles II Gonzaga, titular Duke of Mantua (1609 - 14 August 1631). His heir and nominal co-ruler. Better known as Duke of Nevers and Rethel. Married heiress Maria Gonzaga. They were parents to Eleanor of Mantua consort of the Hol
2 CONC y Roman Emperor Ferdinand III, and Charles III, Duke of Mantua.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ferdinand, Duke of Mayenne (1610 - 25 May 1632).
2 CONT
2 CONT Ludwika Maria Gonzaga (18 August 1611 - 10 May 1667). Married first Władysław IV Vasa and secondly John II Casimir of Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Benedetta Gonzaga (1614 - 30 September 1637).
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Maria Gonzaga (1616 - 6 July 1684). Married first Henry II, Duke of Guise and secondly Edward, Count Palatine of Simmern.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Catherine de Mayenne F, #42297, b. circa 1585, d. 18 March 1618
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine de Mayenne|b. c 1585\nd. 18 Mar 1618|p4230.htm#i42297|Charles de Lorraine, Duc de Mayenne|b. 26 Mar 1554\nd. 4 Oct 1611|p4230.htm#i42292|Henriette de Savoie, Marquise de Villars|b. c 1541\nd. 14 Oct 1611|p4230.htm#i42293
2 CONC |François I. de Lorraine, Duc de Guise|b. 1519\nd. 1563|p4228.htm#i42275|Anna d'Este|b. 1531\nd. 1607|p4228.htm#i42276|Honorat I. de Savoie|b. c 4 Jun 1511\nd. 20 Sep 1580|p22019.htm#i220186|Jeanne de Foix, Vicontesse de Castillon
2 CONC |d. 30 May 1542|p22019.htm#i220187|
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=18 Jul 2007
2 CONT      Catherine de Mayenne was born circa 1585.1 She was the daughter of Charles de Lorraine, Duc de Mayenne and Henriette de Savoie, Marquise de Villars. She married Carlo I de Gonzaga, 8th Duca di Mantova, son of Ludovico Gonzaga
2 CONC , Duc de Nevers and Henriette de Nevers, on 1 February 1599.1 She died on 18 March 1618.1 Children of Catherine de Mayenne and Carlo I de Gonzaga, 8th Duca di Mantova 1.Carlo Gonzaga, Duc de Rethel+1 b. 1609, d. 31 Aug 1631 2.Anne
2 CONC  de Gonzaga+ b. 1616, d. 6 Jul 1684 Citations 1.[S102] Roglo Geneweb Website, online <http://geneweb.inria.fr/roglo?lang=en>. Hereinafter cited as Roglo Geneweb Website.
