2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Genevieve de Bourbon-Condé, Duchesse de Longueville was born on 28 August 1619 at Vincennes Caslte. (1) She was the daughter of Henri II de Bourbon-Condé, Prince de Condé and Charlotte de Montmorency. (1) She married Henri II
2 CONC  d'Orléans, Duc de Longueville on 2 June 1642. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 15 April 1679 at age 59 at Paris, France. (1)
