2 CONT Reverend John Murray was the son of Lord Edward Murray and Frances Harland.2 He married Lady Elizabeth Murray, daughter of William Murray, 3rd Earl of Dunmore and Hon. Catherine Murray, on 24 July 1763.1 He died on 18 June 1790.2
2 CONT
2 CONT He held the office of Dean of Killaloe.1
