2 CONT '''Lady Elizabeth Murray''' F, #258014, b. 1743
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Elizabeth Murray was born in 1743.1 She was the daughter of William Murray, 3rd Earl of Dunmore and Hon. Catherine Murray.1 She married Reverend John Murray, son of Lord Edward Murray and Frances Harland, on 24 July 1763.
