1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sir Patrick Murray of Ochtertyre, 4th Bt.''' was born on 21 August 1707 at Monivaird. He was the son of Sir William Murray of Ochtertyne, 3rd Bt. and Catherine Fraser. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married '''Helen Hamilton''', daughter of John Hamilton, on 18 February 1741. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 9 September 1764 at age 57 at Ochtertyre, Perthshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT He gained the title of 4th Baronet Murray.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Other References ==
2 CONT * http://www26.us.archive.org/stream/heraldryofmurray00john#page/40/mode/2up/search/ochtertyre Page 41- (157)
