2 CONT
2 CONT Not to be confused with Elisabeth of Lorraine.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Therese of Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT Queen of Sardinia
2 CONT
2 CONT Reign 	1 April 1737 – 3 July 1741
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse 	Charles Emmanuel III of Sardinia
2 CONT
