1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Luise Franziska Wilhelmine Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #97909, b. 2 March 1725, d. 19 February 1764
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 Nov 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      Luise Franziska Wilhelmine Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm was born on 2 March 1725. She was the daughter of Nikolaus Leopold Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Dorothea Franziska Agnes Prinzessin zu Salm. She married Johann Wilhelm Graf von Man
2 CONC derscheid-Blankenheim on 19 March 1743. She died on 19 February 1764 at age 38.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Luise Franziska Wilhelmine Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm gained the title of Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm. Her married name became von Manderscheid-Blankenheim.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Luise Franziska Wilhelmine Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm and Johann Wilhelm Graf von Manderscheid-Blankenheim
2 CONT
2 CONT Augusta Leopoldine Gräfin von Manderscheid-Blankenheim+ b. 28 Jan 1744, d. 19 Nov 1811
2 CONT
