1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maximilian Friedrich Ernst Prinz zu Salm-Salm 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #97891, b. 28 November 1732, d. 14 September 1773
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Maximilian Friedrich Ernst Prinz zu Salm-Salm was born on 28 November 1732 at Anhalt. He was the son of Nikolaus Leopold Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Dorothea Franziska Agnes Prinzessin zu Salm. He married Marie Luise Eleonore Land
2 CONC gräfin von Hessen-Rheinfels-Rottenburg on 16 March 1756. He died on 14 September 1773 at age 40.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Maximilian Friedrich Ernst Prinz zu Salm-Salm gained the title of Duke of Hoogstraeton. He gained the title of Prinz zu Salm-Salm.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Maximilian Friedrich Ernst Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Marie Luise Eleonore Landgräfin von Hessen-Rheinfels-Rottenburg
2 CONT
