1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Marie Luise Eleonore Landgräfin von Hessen-Rheinfels-Rottenburg
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #97892, b. 18 April 1729, d. 6 January 1800
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=5 Feb 2004
2 CONT
2 CONT      Marie Luise Eleonore Landgräfin von Hessen-Rheinfels-Rottenburg was born on 18 April 1729. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Maximilian Friedrich Ernst Prinz zu Salm-Salm, son of Nikolaus Leopold Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Dorothea Franziska Agnes Prinzessin zu Salm, on 16 March 1756. She died on 6 January 1800 at age 70 at Anhalt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Marie Luise Eleonore Landgräfin von Hessen-Rheinfels-Rottenburg and Maximilian Friedrich Ernst Prinz zu Salm-Salm
2 CONT
