2 CONC  his family; Xavier Marie Joseph de France Duke of Aquitaine 	Grand Royal Coat of Arms of France.svg 	8 September 1753 – 22 February 1754 (aged 0) 	Born at the Palace of Versailles dying there aged 5 months; Louis Auguste de Franc
