2 CONC ; was later King of France; Marie Adélaïde Clotilde Xavière de France Queen of Sardinia 	Madameclotilde.jpg 	23 September 1759 – 7 March 1802 (aged 42) 	Born at Versailles, she married the future Charles Emmanuel IV of Sardinia an
2 CONC d had no issue; Élisabeth Philippine Marie Hélène de France Madame Élisabeth 	Madame-elisabeth-2.jpg 	3 May 1764 – 10 May 1794 (aged 30) 	Born at Versailles, she never married and was executed in the French Revolution aged 30;
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Josepha also had a stillborn son in 1748 and again in 1749. A stillborn daughter in 1752; Stillborn son in 1756. She also miscarried a son in 1762
2 CONT
