2 CONT http://www.archive.org/stream/heraldryofmurray00john#page/24/mode/2up Page 25 No. 106
2 CONT
2 CONT (106) '''John, fourth Duke of Atholl''',  born 30th June 1755 ; died 29th September 1830. On 1 8th August 1786 he was created Earl of Strange, Baron Murray of Stanley in the Peerage of Great Britain. In 1805 he succeeded his mothe
2 CONC r in the Barony of Strange. He married, first, 26th December 1774, Jean, daughter of Charles, ninth Lord Cathcart, who died 5th December 1790, having had:
2 CONT
2 CONT >* 106(a) John (No. 107 below).
2 CONT >* 106(b) James (No. 108 below).
2 CONT >* 106(c) Edward Murray, born 11th September 1783; died 19th March 1795.
2 CONT >* 106(d) Robert Murray, born 13th March 1785; died 5th February 1793.
2 CONT >* 106(e) Frederick Murray, born 13th October 1788; died 11th April 1789.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, second, 11th March 1794, Margery, daughter of James, sixteenth Lord Forbes and widow of John, Lord Macleod. She died 3rd October 1842, having had issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT >* 106(f) Son, born and died 11th March 1797.
2 CONT >* 106(g) Charles Murray, born 11th March 1799; died 11th August 1824.
2 CONT
