2 CONT 4a''' Henry;'''  born 13 June 1767; married 8 Dec 1786 Eliza (died 20 Dec 1847), daughter of Richard Kent, of Liverpool, anddied 3 Dec 1805, leaving, with five daughters:
2 CONT
