2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.archive.org/stream/heraldryofmurray00john#page/24/mode/2up Page 24 - No. 105f
2 CONT
2 CONT 105(f) '''Henry Murray''', born 13th June 1767; died 3rd December 1805. On 8th December 1786 he married Elizabeth, daughter of Richard Kent, who died 20th December 1847, having had:
2 CONT *105(f)1 Richard Murray, born 19th October 1787; died 16th October 1843. He married, first, 1st June 181 1, Catherine, daughter of John J. Bacon, who died 30th April 1817 ; second, 1819, Margaret, daughter of William Tennison, who
2 CONC  died 8th November 1824. He had issue by both wives.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p2223.htm#i22223
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lord Henry Murray'''1 M, #22223, b. 13 June 1767, d. 3 December 1805
2 CONT
2 CONT Lord Henry Murray was born on 13 June 1767.1 He was the son of Sir John Murray, 3rd Duke of Atholl and Lady Charlotte Murray, Baroness Strange.1 He married Eliza Kent, daughter of Richard Kent, on 8 December 1786.1 He died on 3 De
2 CONC cember 1805 at age 38.1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children of Lord Henry Murray and Eliza Kent'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * unknown daughter Murray2
2 CONT * unknown daughter Murray2
2 CONT * unknown daughter Murray2
2 CONT * unknown daughter Murray2
2 CONT * unknown daughter Murray2
2 CONT * Lt.-Col. Richard Murray+1 b. 19 Oct 1787, d. 16 Oct 1843
