2 CONC >≤line />≤line />≤line>"Will" Will of Nathaniel REED: Dated September 1798 Probated 24 January 1799 Book C, Page 150, Roll 532 Anderson Co. SC≤/line>≤line />≤line>Will of Nathaniel Reid (Nathaniel Reed) names:≤/line>≤line />≤line>
2 CONC Wife, Elizabeth,
2 CONT William Reed, eldest son
2 CONT Nathaniel Reed, second son
2 CONT Stephen Reed, third son and last son
2 CONT Elizabeth Brown, daughter
2 CONT Winifred Hood, daughter
2 CONT Sady Shotwell, daughter (Believe transcriber mistook E for an S)
2 CONT William Reed, son, Executor
2 CONT Nathaniel Reed, son, Executor
2 CONT Hugh Brown, Executor
2 CONT George Keith, Witness
2 CONT Cornelius Keith, Witness
2 CONT Wife Elizabeth to have a negro wench Nan.
2 CONT Three youngest daughters Elizabeth Brown, Winifred Hood, Sade (Should be Eady) Shotwell.
2 CONT Two eldest daughters Rachel Adams and Anne Adams.
2 CONT Eldest son William Reed to have negro fellow Will.
2 CONT Second son Nathaniel Reed to have negro fellow Peter.
2 CONT Third and last son Stephen Reed to have negro boy Jess.
2 CONT Executors: Sons William and Nathaniel Reed and Hugh Brown.
2 CONT Witnesses: J. Keith (Signed) Nathaniel ( NR ) Reed
