1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT <strong>MURRAY, 5TH EARL OF DUNMORE, GEORGE</strong>. 30/04/1762-11/11/1836. Ref: 1013. Male.
2 CONT * Titles and British Honours: 5th Earl of Dunmore, Baron Dunmore of Dunmore (1831).
2 CONT * Place of Death: Glenfinart, Argyllshire.
2 CONT * Profession: Landowner.
2 CONT * Appointments Held: Independent means.
2 CONT * Marital Status: Married (1803) Susan,daughter of 9th Duke of Hamilton.
2 CONT * Mother: Lady Charlotte Stewart.
2 CONT * Father: John Murray, 4th Earl of Dunmore.
2 CONT * References: The Scots Peerage, vol 3. 392; Burke's Landed Gentry.
2 CONT * Notes: Date of Election not traced.
