1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://familysearch.org/tree/person/details/GHNH-MMF FamilySearch Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 15 2024, 4:59:11 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/288622639/susan-douglas
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Susan Murray was into wealth on 17th June 1767 at Airth
2 CONT
2 CONT Sterling Scotland to John Murray 4th Earl of Dunmore
2 CONT
2 CONT (1730-1809) and Lady Charolette Stewart Countess of Dunmore
2 CONT
2 CONT (1740-1818). They had 10 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan Married 3 times: (1) Joseph Tharp of Chippenham Park
2 CONT
2 CONT (1767-1797). They had 2 children: John Tharp of Chippenham
2 CONT
2 CONT Park (1794-1883) and Charlotte Stewart Tharp (1791-1809). (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT John Drew (1764-1800). They had 2 children: Lucy Ann Drew
2 CONT
2 CONT (1798-1833) and Georgianna Drew (1801-1828). (3) Rev. Archibald
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward Douglas (1770-1855) and they had one child Augusta
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Douglass Baroness of Castltown (1811-1899).
2 CONT
2 CONT Gravesite Details
2 CONT UK, Records of the Removal of Graves and Tombstones,
2 CONT 1601-2007 for Susan Douglas
2 CONT Hove St Andrew's Old Church 1975
2 CONT Tombstone was removed in 1972 and St. Andrew's C of E (aided)
2 CONT Primary School was built over this portion of the churchyard.
