1 TITL Sir
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sir William Murray of Ochtertyre, 5th Bt.''' was born on 23 October 1746 at Ochtertyre, Perthshire, Scotland.  He was the son o'''f Sir Patrick Murray of Ochtertyre, 4th Bt''' and '''Helen Hamilton'''. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married '''Augusta Mackenzie''', daughter of George Mackenzie, 3rd Earl of Cromarty and Isabel Gordon, on 6 March 1770.1 He died on 6 December 1800 at age 54 at Ochtertyre, Perthshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived Ochtertyre.4 He gained the title of 5th Baronet Murray.
2 CONT
