1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Graham, Elizabeth, of Fintry, afterwards Mrs. Douglas of Brigton. Seated in an armchair in front of a tree, turned to right and looking in same direction ; white dress, blue waist-band, muslin frill round neck ; he
2 CONC r right arm rests on arm of chair, her hands lie folded in her lap ; three-quarter length, life-size ; 35 x 26. Purchased from the family; Sedelmeyer, 1905. E. R. Bacon, Esq., New York. Sedelmeyer ; Wallis & Son, 1910.
