2 CONT
2 CONT '''From [https://www.scotlandspeople.gov.uk/search-records/church-registers/church-births-baptisms#form&record_type=opr_births&surname=Graham&surname_so=exact&forename_so=exact&from_year=1754&to_year=1810&parent_names=Robert&paren
2 CONC t_names_so=exact&parent_name_two=Margaret%20Eliz&parent_name_two_so=starts&sort=asc&order=Date&field=year Scotland's People: Old Parish Registers - Births and Baptisms]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Possible list of 11 children of Robert Graham and Margaret Eliza. Milne from first: 18 October 1774 Robert Graham to last: 9 April 1802 Carolin Kneas [Aeneas] M Graham
2 CONT
2 CONT * 18 October 1774 birth or baptism of Robert Graham, son of Robert Graham and Margaret Eliza. Milne [child 1], in the parish of Monifieth
2 CONT * 20 June 1776 birth or baptism of Isabella Graham, daughter of Robert Graham and Margaret Eliza. Milne [child 2], in the parish of Monifieth
2 CONT * 24 April 1778 birth or baptism of John Graham, son of Robert Graham and Margaret Eliza. Milne [child 3], in the parish of Monifieth
2 CONT * 23 November 1779 birth or baptism of Margaret Murray Graham, daughter of Robert Graham and Margaret Eliza. Milne [child 4], in the parish of Monifieth
2 CONT * 10 June 1781 birth or baptism of Thomas Graham, son of Robert Graham and Margaret Eliza. Milne [child 5], in the parish of Monifieth
2 CONT * 13 April 1783 birth or baptism of Ann Graham, daughter of Robert Graham and Margaret Eliza. Milne [child 6], in the parish of Monifieth
2 CONT * 28 January 1785 birth or baptism of David Graham, son of Robert Graham and Margaret Eliza. Milne [child 7], in the parish of Monifieth
2 CONT * 3 February 1787 birth or baptism of Elizth Kinlock Graham, (U) [daughter] of Robert Graham and Margaret Eliza. Milne [child 8], in the parish of Monifieth
2 CONT * 5 December 1788 birth or baptism of Elizabeth Graham, daughter of Robert Graham and Margaret Eliza. Milne [child 9], in the parish of Monifieth
2 CONT * 12 August 1790 birth or baptism of Christian Helen Graham, (U) [daughter] of Robert Graham and Margaret Eliza. Milne [child 10], in the parish of Monifieth
2 CONT * 9 April 1802 birth or baptism of Carolin Kneas [Aeneas] M Graham, (U) [daughter] of Robert Graham and Margaret Eliza. Milne [child 11], in the parish of Monifieth
2 CONT
2 CONT '''From [https://archive.org/details/genealogicalhera01byuburk/page/672/mode/2up?q=Robert+Graham A genealogical and heraldic history of the landed gentry of Great Britain & Ireland by Sir Bernard Burke Volume 1 Published 1879 Page
2 CONC  672]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Graham, 12th of Fintry, born 17 January 1749; married Margaret Elizabeth Mylne, daughter of Thomas Mylne, Esq. of Mylnefield (by Isabella Gray his wife, only daughter of Dr. George Gray, of Huntingdon, younger son of Gray, 
2 CONC of Hackerton, a son of the ennobled house of Gray), and had issue,
2 CONT
2 CONT * Robert Graham, assassinated at Benares 1799, aged 24.  
2 CONT * John Graham, heir to his father.  
2 CONT * Captain Thomas Graham, R.N., married Maria Dundas, daughter of Admiral George Dundas; and died at Valparaiso, 9 April, 1822.  
2 CONT * David Graham, born 28 January 1785, died unmarried 11 September 1824.  
2 CONT * Isabella Anne Graham, married General the Hon. John Brodrick.  
2 CONT * Elizabeth Graham, married James Keay, Esq. of Snaigon, Perthshire 
2 CONT * Helen Christian Graham, married Henry Cloete, Esq., eldest son of Laurence Cloete, Esq. of Zamdvleete, C.B.S., and has Issue.  
2 CONT * Mary Cathcart Graham.  
2 CONT * Jemima Agnes Graham, married Major William Bolden Dundas.  
2 CONT * Emily Georgina Graham. 
2 CONT * Catharine Margaret Graham.  
2 CONT * Roberta Graham.  
2 CONT * Caroline A. Mackay Graham, married 12 July, 1830, A. Morton Carr, Esq., Solicitor of Excise, Scotland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The 12th Laird of Fintry died 10 January 1815.
