1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Augusta Leopoldine Gräfin von Manderscheid-Blankenheim (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #116359, b. 28 January 1744, d. 19 November 1811
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=23 Jun 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Augusta Leopoldine Gräfin von Manderscheid-Blankenheim was born on 28 January 1744. She is the daughter of Johann Wilhelm Graf von Manderscheid-Blankenheim and Luise Franziska Wilhelmine Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm. She married P
2 CONC hilipp Christian Graf von Sternberg on 7 November 1762. She died on 19 November 1811 at age 67.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Augusta Leopoldine Gräfin von Manderscheid-Blankenheim gained the title of Gräfin von Manderscheid-Blankenheim.1 Her married name became von Sternberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Augusta Leopoldine Gräfin von Manderscheid-Blankenheim and Philipp Christian Graf von Sternberg
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Franz Josef Adam Johann Graf von Sternberg-Manderscheid+ b. 4 Sep 1763, d. 18301
2 CONT
