2 CONT Full name
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis Stanislas Xavier de France
2 CONT
2 CONT Father 	Louis, Dauphin of France
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother 	Princess Maria Josepha of Saxony
2 CONT
