2 CONC a son, Napoleon deposed of her without resorting to divorce, the marriage nullified on the grounds (1810) that a parish priest wasn't present at the ceremony. Josephine, however, continued to live in her private residence entertai
2 CONC ning lavishly with Napoleon paying the bills, at least 'til he later abdicated.
