2 CONT * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/H%C3%B4tel_de_Chimay '''Hotel de La Pagerie'''] ; 
2 CONT * '''Hôtel de La Pagerie'''
2 CONT >* During the First Empire, '''Napoleon I''' gave the hôtel to Stéphanie Tascher de La Pagerie (1788–1832), the cousin of Empress Joséphine. Stéphanie was given the hôtel on 1 February 1808, after her marriage to Prosper Louis, Du
2 CONC ke of Arenburg. The décor was redesigned in the fashionable Empire style.
