2 CONT Louis-Francois-Auguste de Rohan-Chabot (1788-1833) was a French aristocrat and Catholic priest. He was Prince of Leon, the 8th Duke of Rohan, and Count of Porhoët. Upon becoming a widower, he entered the priesthood and eventually 
2 CONC became Archbishop of Auch, Archbishop of Besançon, and a Cardinal.
