1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Charles Antonin, comte de Noailles''' was born circa March 13, 1810 in Paris, Île-de-France, France. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-26775174293 Antonin Claude Dominique Just, duc de Mouchy] and [https://www.geni
2 CONC .com/profile-26775093293 Mélanie de Talleyrand-Périgord,]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles Antonin married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34784974248 Countess Anna Marie Hélène] on April 25, 1849 in Paris 1ʿ, 75101, , Seine, Ile-de-France,. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34784975302 Infant Van Noailles]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on August 24, 1852 in Seine-et-Marne, Île-de-France, France. 
