2 CONT ==Amelia Prinzessin Berzenheim von Regécz
2 CONT 1 F, #470958 Last Edited=30 May 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Amelia Prinzessin Berzenheim von Regécz is the daughter of Charles Augustus Prinz Berzenheim von Regécz.1 She married Louis Patrick John Taaffe, 9th Viscount Taaffe of Corren, son of Rodolphus Taaffe, 7th Viscount Taaffe of Corren
2 CONC  and Josephine Gräfin Haugwitz, on 10 June 1822.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Amelia Prinzessin Berzenheim von Regécz and Louis Patrick John Taaffe, 9th Viscount Taaffe of Corren
2 CONT #General Charles Rudoph Joseph Francis Taaffe, 10th Viscount Taaffe of Corren1 b. 26 Apr 1823, d. 19 Nov 1873
2 CONT #Hon. Walburga Clementina Rudolphina Francesca Taaffe1 b. 23 Oct 1825, d. 13 Sep 1882
2 CONT #Amelia Rudolphina Henrietta Taaffe1 b. 1829, d. 1830
2 CONT #Amelia Walburga Taaffe1 b. 1830
2 CONT #Edward Francis Joseph Taaffe, 11th Viscount Taaffe of Corren+1 b. 24 Feb 1833, d. 29 Nov 1895
