1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://thepeerage.com/p2956.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Caroline Leonora Murray'''1 F, #29557, d. 8 January 1819
2 CONT
2 CONT Caroline Leonora Murray was the daughter of Rt. Rev. Lord George Murray and Anne Charlotte Grant.1 She married Henry Stephen Fox-Strangways, 3rd Earl of Ilchester, son of Henry Thomas Fox-Strangways, 2nd Earl of Ilchester and Mary
2 CONC  Theresa O'Grady, on 16 June 1812.1 She died on 8 January 1819.1
2 CONT
2 CONT As a result of her marriage, Caroline Leonora Murray was styled as Countess of Ilchester on 16 June 1812. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children of Caroline Leonora Murray and Henry Stephen Fox-Strangways, 3rd Earl of Ilchester'''
2 CONT * Caroline Margaret Fox-Strangways1 d. 26 Jun 1895
2 CONT * Lady Theresa Anna Maria Fox-Strangways+1 b. c 1814, d. 2 May 1874
2 CONT * Henry Thomas Leopold Fox-Strangways, Lord Stavordale1 b. 7 Jan 1816, d. 11 Aug 1837
2 CONT * Stephen Fox-Strangways, Lord Stavordale1 b. 21 Mar 1817, d. 25 May 1848
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Citations===
2 CONT
