2 CONT 4b''' Edward (Rev); born 5 Nov 1798; Vicar Northolt,''' Middx, Preb St Paul's; married 14 Feb 1822 Ruperta Catherine (died5 Sept 1871), only child of Sir George Wright, Bt (see 1949 edn), and died 1 July 1852, 
