1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ''Not listed on Burke's Peerage online''
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p1755.htm#i17550
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Henry Otway'''1 M, #17550, d. 13 September 1815
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Otway was the son of Cooke Otway.2 He married Sarah Cave, Baroness Braye, daughter of Sir Thomas Cave, 6th Bt. and Sarah Edwards, on 25 February 1790 at St. George's Church, St. George Street, Hanover Square, London, England
2 CONC .3 He died on 13 September 1815.3 He was buried at Stanford Hall, Rugby, Northamptonshire, England.3
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived at Castle Otway, County Tipperary, Ireland.4 He held the office of High Sheriff of Leicestershire in 1804.3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children of Henry Otway and Sarah Cave, Baroness Braye'''
2 CONT * Hon. Robert Otway-Cave3 d. 29 Nov 1844
2 CONT * Hon. Anne Otway-Cave3 d. 22 May 1871
2 CONT * Hon. Catherine Otway-Cave1 d. 4 Nov 1875
2 CONT * Hon. Maria Otway-Cave3 b. 24 Dec 1792, d. 13 May 1879
2 CONT * Henrietta Otway-Cave, Baroness Braye+3 b. 3 Nov 1809, d. 14 Nov 1879
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Citations===
2 CONT
