2 CONT * 1b '''James Arthur''';  (105(e)1 born 25 May 1790; V-Adml; married 1st 13 Dec 1821 Harriet (died 27 July 1829), daughter of William Coupland, and had:
2 CONT * 1c James; born 3 July 1829; Lt RE; killed 18 June 1855 Sebastopol
2 CONT * 1c Harriet Coupland; married 7 Oct 1852 Harvey Winson Fellows (died 13 Jan 1907) and died 8 Feb 1893, leaving issue
2 CONT
2 CONT 1b (cont) V-Adml James Murray married 2nd 3 May 1838 Julia (died 31 Dec 1878), daughter of John Delmé, of Cams Hall, and died 6 March 1860,  having by her had:
2 CONT * 2c William Frederick; born 5 Jan 1845; Cdr RN
2 CONT * 3c George Delmé; born 6 Oct 1854; married 3 July 1877 Sarah (died 31 Dec 1939), daughter of Alphonse Loney, anddied 1 April 1915
2 CONT * 2c Julia Frances Delmé; married 18 Dec 1862 Adml Sir Richard Vesey Hamilton, GCB (died 17 Sept 1912), and died4 June 1897, leaving issue
2 CONT * 3c Mary Ann; married A E Harston and died 1891
2 CONT * 4c Margaret Amelia; married Martin Seal and died 1910
2 CONT * 5c Louisa Mary; married 13 Nov 1872 Cdr Hugh H Hannay, RN, and died 18 Feb 1874
2 CONT
