2 CONT 105(e) William Murray, born 20th March 1762 ; died 29th December 1796. He married, 14th June 1789, Mary, daughter of James Hodges, who died 29th May 1827, leaving:
2 CONT *105(e)1 '''Vice-Admiral James Arthur Murray''', born 25th March 1790; died 5th March i860. He married, first, 13th December 1821, Harriet, daughter of William Coupland; and, second, 3rd May 1838, Julia, daughter of John Delme. Is
2 CONC sue by both wives.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
