2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p2240.htm#i22391
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Vice-Admiral James Arthur Murray'''1 M, #22391, b. 25 May 1790, d. 6 March 1860
2 CONT
2 CONT Vice-Admiral James Arthur Murray was born on 25 May 1790.1 He was the son of Lord William Murray and Mary Anne Hodges.1 He married, firstly, Harriet Coupland, daughter of William Coupland, on 13 December 1821.1 He married, secondl
2 CONC y, Julia Delmé, daughter of John Delmé, on 3 May 1838.1 He died on 6 March 1860 at age 69.1
2 CONT
2 CONT He gained the rank of Vice-Admiral in the service of the Royal Navy.1
2 CONT
