2 CONT * Margaret Amelia Murray1 d. 1910
2 CONT * Louisa Mary Murray1 d. 18 Feb 1874
2 CONT * Julia Frances Delmé Murray1 b. c 1842, d. 4 Jun 1897
2 CONT * Commander William Frederick Murray1 b. 5 Jan 1845, d. 8 Nov 1873
