2 CONT 105(f) Henry Murray, born 13th June 1767; died 3rd December 1805. On 8th December 1786 he married Elizabeth, daughter of Richard Kent, who died 20th December 1847, having had:
2 CONT *105(f)1 '''Richard Murray''', born 19th October 1787; died 16th October 1843. He married, first, 1st June 181 1, Catherine, daughter of John J. Bacon, who died 30th April 1817 ; second, 1819, Margaret, daughter of William Tenniso
2 CONC n, who died 8th November 1824. He had issue by both wives.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
