2 CONT
2 CONT Lt.-Col. Richard Murray1 M, #22452, b. 19 October 1787, d. 16 October 1843
2 CONT
2 CONT Lt.-Col. Richard Murray was born on 19 October 1787.1 He was the son of Lord Henry Murray and Eliza Kent.1 He married, firstly, Catherine Bacon, daughter of John Joseph Bacon and Ann Cosnahan, on 1 June 1811.1 He married, secondly
2 CONC , Margaret Tennison, daughter of William Tennison, in 1819.2 He died on 16 October 1843 at age 55 at Mount Murray, Isle of Man.2,3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Child of Lt.-Col. Richard Murray and Margaret Tennison'''
2 CONT *Margaret Murray2 d. 13 Jun 1859
2 CONT
