2 CONT John Murray-Aynsley1 M, #22456, b. 2 June 1795, d. March 1870
2 CONT
2 CONT John Murray-Aynsley was born on 2 June 1795.1 He was the son of Very Rev. Lord Charles Murray-Aynsley and Alicia Mitford.1 He married Emma Sarah Peach, daughter of Samuel Peach Peach, on 24 June 1820.1 He died in March 1870 at age
2 CONC  74.1
2 CONT
