1 NAME de/hameldon/
1 NAME Douglas Hamilton, 8th Duke of Hamilton
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 24 JUL 1756
2 ADDR
3 CITY Edinburgh
3 STAE City of Edinburgh
3 CTRY UK
1 DEAT
2 DATE 2 AUG 1799
