1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.thepeerage.com/p37631.htm#i376301
2 CONT Lt.-Gen. Berkeley Drummond was born on 27 May 1796. He was the son of Charles Drummond and Frances Dorothy Lockwood. He married Maria Crosbie, daughter of William Arthur Crosbie and Elizabeth Falkiner, on 5 April 1832. He died on 
2 CONC 4 May 1860 at age 63. He was Extra Groom-in-Waiting to HM Queen Victoria. He lived at Eaglehurst, Hampshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/dd/drummond03.php
