1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sir Patrick Murray of Ochtertyre, 6th Bt.''' was born on 3 February 1771. He was the son of Sir William Murray of Ochtertyre, 5th Bt. and Augusta Mackenzie. He married '''Lady Mary Anne Hope''', daughter of John
2 CONC  Hope, 2nd Earl of Hopetoun and Lady Elizabeth Leslie, on 13 December 1794. He died on 1 June 1837 at age 66.
2 CONT
2 CONT He gained the title of 6th Baronet Murray. He lived Ochtertyre.2 In 1793 advocate , Baron Court Exchequer Scotland 1820
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Patrick Murray of Ochtertyre, 6th Bt. is Edward III, king of England's 12th great grandson.
2 CONT
