2 CONT Married: At Ochtertyre, on Wednesday, 28 September 1808 James Glassford, Esq. advocate, to Miss Murray, daughter of the late Sir William Murray, Baronet of Ochtertyre. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ochtertyre Ochtertyre House, St
2 CONC rathearn, Perthshire, PH7 4JR 56.3906, -3.8826]
