1 NAME Archibald Murray /Douglas/ Maj.,
2 GIVN Archibald Murray
2 SURN Douglas
2 NSFX Maj.,
2 _MARNM Douglas
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 17 JAN 1790
1 DEAT
2 DATE 6 FEB 1872
