2 CONT Robert Graham, 12th of Fintry, born 17 January 1749; married Margaret Elizabeth Mylne, daughter of Thomas Mylne, Esq. of Mylnefield (by Isabella Gray his wife, only daughter of Dr. George Gray, of Huntingdon, younger son of Gray, 
2 CONC of Hackerton, a son of the ennobled house of Gray), and had issue, ...
2 CONT
2 CONT * Captain Thomas Graham, R.N., married Maria Dundas, daughter of Admiral George Dundas; and died at Valparaiso, 9 April 1822. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''From [https://www.lordbyron.org/persRec.php?&selectPerson=ThGraha1822 Lord Byron - Thomas Grahame]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Lieutenant Thomas Grahame (died 1822)
2 CONT
2 CONT Lieutenant in the Royal Navy; he married Maria Dundas [afterwards Calcott] in 1809, and died at sea in 1822. He was the nephew of the poet James Grahame.
2 CONT
2 CONT Died at sea while in command of Doris Frigate on the way from England to Chile.
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: not sure of the connection to [https://www.geni.com/people/Rev-James-Grahame/6000000018173602024 Rev. James Grahame] - needs to be checked
