2 CONT Died: At [33 Melville Street, Edinburgh EH3 7JF 55.9503375, -3.2129941], on Friday, 26 May 1837, Mary Caroline Carr, wife of Andrew Morton Carr, Esq. and youngest daughter of the late Robert Graham, Esq., of Fintry.
