1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Name:	Chesley B. Bostick
2 CONT Gender:	Male
2 CONT Spouse:	Susan S. Stovall
2 CONT Spouse Gender:	Female
2 CONT Marriage Date:	9 May 1852
2 CONT County:	Franklin
2 CONT State:	Tennessee
2 CONT * https://www.ancestry.com/discoveryui-content/view/35965:4125
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bostick-474 WikiTree Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 14 2022, 21:21:10 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Chesley Butler Bostick was the son of Floyd and Rosannah Murray Bostick. 
2 CONT He was born in Tennessee and was the brother of Alfred, Ann, Matthew,and  Nathaniel. 
2 CONT '''With his first wife, Frances Griffin Bostick''', he was the father of 
2 CONT # William,  
2 CONT # Elizabeth,and  
2 CONT # Nathan. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Frances passed in 1851. 
2 CONT In 1852, he '''married Susanah (Susan) Stovall (Bostick)''', a relative of his brother Nathaniel's wife, Caroline Stovall Bostick. 
2 CONT They had 
2 CONT # Frances, 
2 CONT # Mary, 
2 CONT # George, and 
2 CONT # J.E.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/131509618/chesley-butler-bostick Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 14 2022, 21:23:16 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Census:
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * 
2 CONT ----
