1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bostick-647 WikiTree Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 14 2022, 21:21:10 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann was the daughter of Floyd and Rosannah Murray Bostick and the sister of Alfred, Chesley Butler, Nathaniel, and Matthew Bostick. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann married Larkin Poteete, a Frenchman, and and they were the parents of Sarah Annie, Margaret M., Mary E., and James R. Poteete.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfred, Ann's brother, with Ann and Larkin, moved to the state of Arkansas with their families around 1844.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/131552989/ann-poteete Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/proj
2 CONC ects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 14 2022, 21:23:16 UTC''
2 CONT
