2 CONT F, #96881, b. 11 May 1770, d. 16 June 1806
2 CONT
2 CONT * Last Edited=5 Feb 2004
2 CONT * Maria Walburga Gräfin von Sternberg-Manderscheid was born on 11 May 1770 at Prague, Czech Republic. 
2 CONT * She was the '''daughter'''-  of Philipp Christian Graf von Sternberg and Augusta Leopoldine Gräfin von Manderscheid-Blankenheim. 
2 CONT * She '''married''' - Konstantin Alexander Joseph Prinz zu Salm-Salm, son of Maximilian Friedrich Ernst Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Marie Luise Eleonore Landgräfin von Hessen-Rheinfels-Rottenburg, on 4 February 1788 at Vinac, Bohemia. 
2 CONC She died on 16 June 1806 at age 36.
2 CONT * '''Children''' of Maria Walburga Gräfin von Sternberg-Manderscheid and Konstantin Alexander Joseph Prinz zu Salm-Salm
2 CONT
