2 CONT      Franziska Gräfin von Sternberg-Manderscheid was born in 1805. She was the daughter of Franz Josef Adam Johann Graf von Sternberg-Manderscheid and Maria Franziska Sofie Carol Gräfin von Schonborn-Heussenstamm. She married, fir
2 CONC stly, Joseph Prinz von Lobkowicz in 1829. She married, secondly, Count Karl Johann Patrick O'Hagerty in 1837. She died in 1845.
2 CONT
2 CONT      From 1829, her married name became von Lobkowicz. From 1837, her married name became O'Hagerty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Franziska Gräfin von Sternberg-Manderscheid and Joseph Prinz von Lobkowicz
2 CONT
