2 CONT      Eleonore Wilhelmine Luise Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm was born on 6 December 1794. She was the daughter of Konstantin Alexander Joseph Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Maria Walburga Gräfin von Sternberg-Manderscheid. She married Alfred Fr
2 CONC anz Friedrich Philipp Herzog von Croÿ, son of Auguste Philippe Louis Emanuel Herzog von Croÿ and Anne-Victurniene Henriette de Rochechouart, on 21 June 1819. She died on 6 January 1871 at age 76.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name became von Croÿ.
