1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Mélanie de Talleyrand-Périgord,''' was born on September 8, 1785 in France. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626431191 Archambaud de Talleyrand-Périgord, I. duc de Talleyrand] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-3
2 CONC 021042 Sabine Sabine Olivier de Sénozan]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mélanie married [https://www.geni.com/profile-26775174293 Antonin Claude Dominique Just, duc de Mouchy] on May 11, 1803. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-26775246293 Charles Philippe de Noailles, V. duc de Mouchy];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34784975301 Charles Antonin, comte de Noailles];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626523682 Amédée Adéláïde Louis de Noailles];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626523339 Angélique Léontine Sabine Alexandrine de Noailles]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on February 19, 1863, in Versailles, France. 
