2 CONT Sir Herbert Harley Murray was born on 4 November 1829.1 He was the son of Rt. Rev. George Murray and Lady Sarah Maria Hay-Drummond.1 He married Charlotte Letitia Caroline Arbuthnot, daughter of Lt.-Gen. Charles George James Arbuth
2 CONC not, on 12 July 1859.1 He died on 11 March 1904 at age 74.
