2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p2267.htm#i22670
2 CONT
2 CONT Maj.-Gen. George Herbert Murray-Aynsley1 M, #22670, b. 4 September 1826, d. 10 December 1887
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Maj.-Gen. George Herbert Murray-Aynsley''' was born on 4 September 1826.1 He was the son of John Murray-Aynsley and Emma Sarah Peach.1 He married Emily Hand, daughter of Robert Hand, on 12 February 1848.1 He died on 10 December
2 CONC  1887 at age 61.1 He was buried on 14 December 1887 at Kensal Green Cemetery, London, England.2
2 CONT
2 CONT He gained the rank of Major-General in the service of the Madras Army.1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children of Maj.-Gen. George Herbert Murray-Aynsley and Emily Hand'''
2 CONT * Emma Murray-Aynsley1 d. 28 Sep 1923
2 CONT * Clara Emily Stewart Murray-Aynsley1 d. 3 Sep 1894
2 CONT * Maud Murray-Aynsley1 d. 3 Mar 1898
2 CONT * Alice Elizabeth Murray-Aynsley+1 d. 31 Jan 1896
2 CONT * Charles Edward Murray-Aynsley1 b. 31 Jan 1851, d. 20 Apr 1918
2 CONT * John Percy Murray-Aynsley1 b. 6 Jun 1853
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Citations'''
2 CONT * [S8] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 106th edition, 2 volumes (Crans, Switzerland: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 1999), volume 1, page 138. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Peerage and Baronetage,
2 CONC  106th edition.
2 CONT * [S4567] Bill Norton, "re: Pitman Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger LUNDY (101053), 6 April 2010 and 19 April 2011. Hereinafter cited as "re: Pitman Family."
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
