2 CONT
2 CONT 105(g)1 John Murray- Aynsley of Underdown,  P# 22456 Hereford, born 2nd June 1795; died 25th March 1870. He married, 24th June 1820, Emma, daughter of Samuel Peach Peach (formerly Cruger), who died February 1876, leaving issue:
2 CONT * '''105(g)1(a) Vice - Admiral Charles Murray- Aynsley,''' C.B., of Hall Court, Hants, born 21st September 1821 ; died 1st April 1901. He married, 9th December 1861, Augusta, daughter of W. G. Campion, who died 16th June 1893, lea
2 CONC ving:
2 CONT
2 CONT >* 105(g)1(a)1 Captain John Francis Murray - Aynsley, R.N., born 27th October 1866; died unmarried 10th May 1904, and was succeeded by his sister.
2 CONT
