2 CONT
2 CONT '''Captain James Athole Murray-Aynsley'''1 M, #22663, b. 18 June 1823, d. 28 March 1869
2 CONT
2 CONT Captain James Athole Murray-Aynsley was born on 18 June 1823.1 He was the son of John Murray-Aynsley and Emma Sarah Peach.1 He married Hannah Maria Justin, daughter of John Justin, on 23 October 1855.1 He died on 28 March 1869 at 
2 CONC age 45.1
2 CONT
2 CONT He gained the rank of Captain in the service of the British Army.1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Child of Captain James Athole Murray-Aynsley and Hannah Maria Justin'''
2 CONT * Clara Adelaide Murray-Aynsley1 b. 15 Oct 1867
2 CONT
