2 CONT 1b3c John Cruger (Rev), JP (Herefs); b 21 Feb 1825; Rector Walton and Weston; m 6 July 1852 Harriet Georgina Maria (d 6 Aug 1898), dau of  Rev Fredericj Manners-Sutton (see RUTLAND, D) and dsp 19 Jan 1913
