2 CONT '''Reverend John Cruger Murray-Aynsley'''1 M, #22668, b. 21 February 1825, d. 19 January 1913
2 CONT
2 CONT Reverend John Cruger Murray-Aynsley was born on 21 February 1825 at Tockington, Gloucestershire, England.1,2 He was the son of John Murray-Aynsley and Emma Sarah Peach.1 He married Harriet Georgina Maria Manners-Sutton, daughter o
2 CONC f Reverend Frederick Manners-Sutton and Henrietta Barbara Lumley, on 6 July 1852.1 He died on 19 January 1913 at age 87.1
2 CONT
2 CONT He held the office of Justice of the Peace (J.P.) for Herefordshire.1 He was the Rector at Walton-in-Gordano, Somerset, England.1
2 CONT
