2 CONC  He was Colonel of the Sussex Militia between 1819 and 1860.6 He succeeded to the title of 5th Baron of Settrington, co. York [E., 1675] on 28 August 1819.2 He succeeded to the title of 5th Duke of Lennox [S., 1675] on 28 August 1
