2 CONC  Tarves and Kellie1682] on 14 December 1860. He succeeded to the title of 5th Earl of Aberdeen [S., 1682] on 14 December 1860.2 He succeeded to the title of 7th Baronet Gordon, of Haddo, co. Aberdeen [S., 1642] on 14 December 1860
2 CONC . He succeeded to the title of 5th Vt of Formartine [S., 1682] on 14 December 1860.
