1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Stewart_Mackenzie-5 WikiTree Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 29 2018, 15:14:34 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Keith William Stewart-Mackenzie was born on 6 May 1818.2 He was the son of Rt. Hon. James Alexander Stewart-Mackenzie and Hon. Mary Frederica Elizabeth Mackenzie. He married, firstly, Hannah Charlotte Hope-Vere, daughter of James 
2 CONC Joseph Hope-Vere and Lady Elizabeth Hay, on 17 May 1844. He married, secondly, Alicia Almira Seymour Bell, daughter of R. H. Bell, on 2 June 1871.He died on 18 June 1881 at age 63.
2 CONT
2 CONT He held the office of Deputy Lieutenant (D.L.) He lived at Seaforth, Lancashire, England.
