1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Louisa Caroline Baring, Lady Ashburton''' was born on March 5, 1827, in Seaforth Lodge, Stornoway, Isle of Lewis and was baptized on April 8, 1827, in Stornoway, Ross and Cromarty, Scotland. Her parents were * * [https://www.ge
2 CONC ni.com/profile-82037614 Rt Hon James Alexander Stewart-Mackenzie] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-82037666 Mary Elizabeth Frederica Mackenzie]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Louisa married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34046336 Bingham Baring, 2nd Baron Ashburton] on November 17, 1858, in Bath House, Piccadilly, Westminster, Middlesex, England . Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34045928 Mary Florence Compton, Marchioness of Northampton]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on February 2, 1903, in Kent House, Knightsbridge, Westminster, London, England from cancer. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
