2 CONT Georgiana married [https://www.geni.com/profile-103191110 John Stuart-Wortley-Mackenzie, 2nd Baron Wharncliffe]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34688995831 Mary Caroline Stuart-Wortley-Mackenzie];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34684238750 Edward Montague Stuart Granville Montague Stuart Wortley Mackenzie];
