1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Murray, Anthony, of Dollerie</strong> — Apprentice to (1) Hay Donaldson ; and (2) John Gibson, Jun. — Eldest son of Anthony Murray, of Dollerie, Perthshire. Born 1802. Died 16th September 1884. Mar. 19th October 1829, Geo
2 CONC rgina, daughter of Sir Patrick Murray of Ochtertyre, Bart."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/historyofsociety00socirich#page/152/mode/2up The Society of Writers to Her Majesty's Signet]; 1890; page 152
