2 CONT She married Laurence Oliphant, 6th of Condie, son of Laurence Oliphant, 5th of Condie and Lilias Oliphant.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died, he was drowned crossing the Water (River) of May.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Oliphant.1 He had two other daughters.1
