1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir David Moncreiffe, Baronet [S. 1685], of Moncreiffe</strong>, only s. and h., b. 31 Dec. 1788 ; suc. to the Baronetcy, 26 March 1818. He m. 12 Jan. 1819, Helen, 2d da. of Æneas Mackay, of Scotstown, co. Peebles. He d. 
2 CONC 20 Nov. 1830, at Moncreiffe House, aged 41. His widow m. (as his 2d wife) 30 Oct. 1849, at St. Peter's, Pimlico, George Angustus Frederick Henry (Bridgeman), 6th Earl of Bradford (who d. 22 March 1865, in his 76th year) and d. at 
2 CONC Cannes, 22 April 1869."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524408#page/n355/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1904; Vol. IV; page 337
