1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Charles MacLean [2474] (Elizabeth Pringle MacLeod 4, Jessie MacDonald 3, James Macdonald of 2, Alexander Old Kingsburgh 1) was born on 2 Feb 1818 in Grogarry, South Uist, Outer Hebrides, Scotland and died on 21 Nov
2 CONC  1906 in Milton, South Uist, Scotland, aged 88.
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles married Margaret (May) Birnie [2477] [MRIN: 836] on 18 Sep 1868 in Grogarry, South Uist, Outer Hebrides, Scotland. Margaret was born on 6 Jan 1843 in Cluny, Aberdeenshire, Scotland and died on 20 May 1930 in Invernayhle, D
2 CONC uror, Argylshire, Scotland, aged 87.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Roderick MacLean [2479] was born in 1871 in South Uist, Outer Hebredes, Scotland.
2 CONT ii. May MacLean [2478] was born on 29 Apr 1871 in South Uist, Outer Hebredes, Scotland.
2 CONT iii. Elizabeth Margaret MacLean [2480] was born on 7 Dec 1872 in Milton, South Uist, Scotland, died on 1
2 CONT May 1961 in Dunblane, Stirling, Scotland, aged 88, and was buried in Duror Burial Ground, Ballaculish,
2 CONT Scotland.
2 CONT iv. William MacLean [2482] was born on 11 Aug 1875 and died on 2 Nov 1941 in Invernayhle, Duror,
2 CONT Argylshire, Scotland, aged 66.
