1 NAME Susanna /Cross/
2 GIVN Susanna
2 SURN Cross
2 _MARNM Bailey
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Bailey Cemetery,  Tyler County, West Virginia, USA
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 8 MAY 1796
