2 CONT  	ii.	 	SARAH CROSS, m. ? CRITCHFIELD.
2 CONT  	iii.	 	AGNES CROSS. 	iv.	 	NIMROD CROSS, b. March 24, 1804.
2 CONT  	v.	 	CHARITY CROSS.
