1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She was born in TN in 1806, the daughter of William Gunn and Sarah "Sallie" Cross. In 1826 (?)  she married Major Ansel Ward and had one daughter; he died. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1826 (?) she married William Scott Compton (1805 TN - 1882 TX); they arrived in Avant Prairie (now Dew) Freestone Co., TX from Morgan Co., AL in the 1850s.
2 CONT
2 CONT Angelina died in 1880 at Dew; she and her husband are buried in the Compton Cemetery. They were parents of the following children. Felix Richard; Thomas Eldridge; Henry Maclin; Edwin Allen; William Francis; Elizabeth Blackmon; Mar
2 CONC y Louisa; James Edward; Mariah Jane; Joseph Elliston; Robert Neville; Willis Winston; DeWitt Kimble. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband:	Ansel Ward
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband:	William Scott Compton
2 CONT
