2 CONC s buried at 2 o'clock this afternoon at State Line Cemetery. He is survived by his widow, Mrs. Mattie Bostick; two daughters, Mrs. Charley Reeves of Montgomery, and Mrs. Bonnie Howard of New Market; one son, Guy Bostick of Winches
2 CONC ter.  The deceased served as pastor of the Grace Chapel Primitive Baptist Church while in Huntsville.  He had been serving in a similar capacity since he moved to Winchester several years ago.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.c
