1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/9XY9-WNP
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Thérèse'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Thérèse Tétreau was born on 1 October 1704, in Contrecoeur, Verchères, Quebec, Canada, her father, Joseph Marie Tetreault, was 27 and her mother, Anne Jarret, was 23. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Pierre Girard on 6 April 1723, in Contrecoeur, Verchères, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 2 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 2nd husband Christophe Brodeur dit Lavigne (1707–1778)
2 CONT on 13 October 1765 in Sainte-Anne-de-Varennes, Québec, Amérique coloniale britannique.
2 CONT No children on record.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 14 May 1778, in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 73, and was buried in Varennes, Lajemmerais, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT
