1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/GMRZ-TSV
2 CONT Brief Life History of Anne'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Anne Tetreault was born about 1711, her father, Joseph Marie Tetreault, was 35 and her mother, Anne Jarret, was 31. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean Marie Brodeur on 11 November 1727, in Verchères, Montreal, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 8 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 28 March 1762, in Varennes, Montreal, Canada, New France, at the age of 52, and was buried in Varennes, Montreal, Canada, New France.
2 CONT
