2 CONT
2 CONT Empress Marie Louise of France, Archduchess of Austria (German: Maria Ludovica Leopoldina Francisca Theresa Josepha Lucia von Österreich 12 December 1791 – 17 December 1847), was the second wife of Emperor Napoleon I of France. Du
2 CONC ring her first marriage, she was Empress of the French. In 1817, she became Duchess of Parma, Piacenza and Guastalla.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the mother of Napoleon II, King of Rome.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents
2 CONT
