1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://www.thepeerage.com/p9794.htm#i97933 thepeerage...] ; [http://gw0.geneanet.org/adecarne?lang=en;pz=arnaud;nz=broquet;ocz=0;p=augustinus+alexander;n=von+silva+tarouca gw0.geneanet.org...] ;  Augustinus Alex
2 CONC ander Graf von Silva-Tarouca M, #97933, b. 14 April 1818, d. 24 October 1872
2 CONT *'''Augustinus Alexander Graf von Silva-Tarouca''' was born on 14 April 1818 at Cech. He was the son of Franz Joseph Lothar Graf von Silva-Tarouca and Leopoldine Gräfin von Sternberg-Manderscheid. He married, firstly, Gisela Gräfi
2 CONC n zu Stolberg-Stolberg on 24 August 1847 at Nordkirchen, Germany. He married, secondly, Countess Helene Kálnoky von Köröspatak on 24 August 1865 at Prodlitz. He died on 24 October 1872 at age 54 at Cech.
2 CONT *Children of Augustinus Alexander Graf von Silva-Tarouca and Gisela Gräfin zu Stolberg-Stolberg
2 CONT *#    Marie Henriette Gräfin von Silva-Tarouca b. 27 Mar 1856, d. 17 Dec 1920
2 CONT *#    Franz Joseph Maria Augustin Graf von Silva-Tarouca+ b. 13 Mar 1858, d. 4 Aug 1936
2 CONT *#    Ernst Emanuel Graf von Silva-Tarouca+ b. 3 Jan 1860, d. 15 Aug 1936
2 CONT
