2 CONT      Countess Ida O'Hagerty was born on 24 June 1844 at Tillysburg. She was the daughter of Count Karl Johann Patrick O'Hagerty and Franziska Gräfin von Sternberg-Manderscheid. She married Franz Graf von und zu Eltz gennant Faust 
2 CONC von Stromberg on 23 May 1865 at Tillysburg. She died on 5 September 1927 at age 83 at St. Florian.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name became von und zu Eltz gennant Faust von Stromberg.
