1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Eleonore Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #96931, b. 1842, d. 1891
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Eleonore Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm was born in 1842. She was the daughter of Franz Joseph Friedrich Philipp Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Marie Josephine Sophie Prinzessin zu Löwenstein-Wertheim-Rosenberg. She married, firstly, Don Ma
2 CONC riano Francisco de Borja Jose Justo Tellez-Giron y Beaufort, Duque de Osuna y de Infantado on 4 April 1866 at Wiesbaden, Hessen, Germany. She married, secondly, Rudolf Maximilian Konstantin Herzog von Croÿ, son of Alfred Franz Fri
2 CONC edrich Philipp Herzog von Croÿ and Eleonore Wilhelmine Luise Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm, in 1884. She died in 1891.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Eleonore Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm gained the title of Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm.
2 CONT
