2 CONT Last Edited=11 Nov 2002
2 CONT
2 CONT      Don Mariano Francisco de Borja Jose Justo Tellez-Giron y Beaufort, Duque de Osuna y de Infantado was born on 19 July 1814 at Madrid, Spain. He married Eleonore Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm, daughter of Franz Joseph Friedrich Phili
2 CONC pp Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Marie Josephine Sophie Prinzessin zu Löwenstein-Wertheim-Rosenberg, on 4 April 1866 at Wiesbaden, Hessen, Germany. He died on 2 June 1882 at age 67 at Chateau de Beauraing.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Don Mariano Francisco de Borja Jose Justo Tellez-Giron y Beaufort, Duque de Osuna y de Infantado gained the title of Duque de Osuna y de Infantado.
2 CONT
