2 CONT
2 CONT Joséphine Maximiliane Eugénie Napoléone de Beauharnais was born on 14 March 1807 at Milan, Italy. (1), (3) She was the daughter of Eugène de Beauharnais, 1st Duc de Leuchtenberg and Auguste Prinzessin von Bayern. (1) She married O
2 CONC skar I Bernadotte, King of Sweden, son of Jean Baptiste Jules Bernadotte, King of Sweden and Bernhardine Eugenie Desirée Clary, on 19 June 1823 at Stockholm, Sweden. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 7 June 1876 at age 69 at Stockholm, Sweden. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      From 19 June 1823, her married name became Josefina Bernadotte.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Joséphine Maximiliane Eugénie Napoléone de Beauharnais and Oskar I Bernadotte, King of Sweden
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Carl XV Bernadotte, King of Sweden+1 b. 3 May 1826, d. 19 Sep 1872
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Gustaf Bernadotte b. 18 Jun 1827, d. 1852
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Oskar II Bernadotte, King of Sweden+ b. 21 Jan 1829, d. 8 Dec 1907
2 CONT
2 CONT -4. Eugenie Bernadotte b. 24 Apr 1830
2 CONT
2 CONT -5. August Bernadotte, Prince of Sweden b. 24 Aug 1831, d. 4 Mar 1873
2 CONT
