0 @N6000000002176664234@ NOTE After Napoleon's overthrow, the kingdom of Saxony was greatly reduced and
1 CONT became a Prussian provence; the truncated kingdom of Saxony became a member
1 CONT of the German Confederation. As result of uprisings in 1830, a constitution
1 CONT was granted the kingdom of Saxony in 1831. The "rule" of Anton is very
1 CONT unclear, except that his "kingdom" was ruled by regency "shared" by his
1 CONT nephew, the future Frederick Augustus II, from 1830-1836. See #1897.
