0 @N6000000002176689175@ NOTE Her full name was Marie-Josephe-Ros Tascher de La Pagerie, living on the
1 CONT Island of Martinique the first 15 years of her life. Flirtatious, Extravagant,
1 CONT irresponsible, with her inability to produce a son, Napoleon deposed of her
1 CONT without resorting to divorce, the marriage nullified on the grounds (1810)
1 CONT that a parish priest wasn't present at the ceremony. Josephine, however,
1 CONT continued to live in her private residence entertaining lavishly with Napoleon
1 CONT paying the bills, at least 'til he later abdicated.
